        "id": 1104704
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-05-03T16:11:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That\u0027s fine, but from experience the macro trick is better than the parameter, as the macros to access register will be necessary.",
      "parentUuid": "10b309a9_a6f46d3b",
      "revId": "95387d8c2ea23cf305bb01be2a8dc74b8d850de0",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
