      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-04-20T23:18:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "can we split that function in 2:\nsend the fifo_flush in one.\nCheck later the FIFO is flushed: this way, we avoid the 10us mandatory wait.",
      "revId": "95387d8c2ea23cf305bb01be2a8dc74b8d850de0",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "32941ef7_570129b9",
        "filename": "driver/accelgyro_icm42607.c",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 194,
      "author": {
        "id": 1446307
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-04-26T14:44:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Reading the FIFO flush to ensure value is 0 is required to have the FIFO flush correctly working and put FIFO out of reset state. Cutting that in 2 would be really tricky since FIFO flush is done when turning the FIFO (meaning all sensors) off. We don\u0027t really now when to read the FIFO flush since all will be off.",
      "parentUuid": "4a819ef8_4b763deb",
      "revId": "95387d8c2ea23cf305bb01be2a8dc74b8d850de0",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
